          <caption>
            <p>Slit-Lamp Examination of Pediatric Zonular Cataract.&#x000a0;This zonular cataract exhibits diffuse and oblique illumination on slit-lamp examination Contributed by Dr. Priyadarshi Gupta, MBBS, (MS) ophthalmology</p>
